old #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]sudo_gate_crash_safe_handoff.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/sudo_gate_crash_safe_handoff.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-11t[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-11t/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gate-creation intent marker and host adjudication[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]gate-intent-adjudication[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate-intent-adjudication: write a durable intent marker at the top of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the shared agent-side gate creation path and make the host runner [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lifecycle fail the run with a needs-attention notification when an [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]intent is left unconsumed.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Codex provider turn-integrity detection[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]codex-turn-integrity[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]codex-turn-integrity: treat a codex turn that ends with an empty final [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]answer plus a command killed at teardown as a provider failure that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]raises for retry instead of returning success.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Sudo skill foreground-execution guidance[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]sudo-skill-foreground-guidance[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sudo-skill-foreground-guidance: update the generated sase_sudo skill [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]template to require foreground execution of sase sudo request and to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]state that any returned tool result means the turn did not end.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end verification of the sudo handoff[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]sudo-e2e-verification[dim] · [dim][/dim]after gate-intent-adjudication, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]codex-turn-integrity, sudo-skill-foreground-guidance[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sudo-e2e-verification: re-run the /root/foobar sudo request to confirm [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate, bundle, and notification creation, and simulate a killed CLI to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]confirm the run now fails loudly.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-11t","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-11t.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-11t.1"},"source_run_id":"run-87d294d7adf0db6787017de755c6df40","started_at":"2026-09-16T14:43:51.531567+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[{"committed_at":1789575265,"sha":"491daa988a2095e3b7ad32105135e87bb6adbf68","subject":"fix(gates): adjudicate lost gate intents"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"dfd733cb363e967f4bf25efef0c4e74b9de668a9e0d63d3e1be13c9e9caec2ef","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-11t.1--code/chat.md","size_bytes":23749},"commits":{"digest":"63c9e8869a9c389f785ea8643f1b99b031830059c6690599d249ba0680503175","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-11t.1--code/commits.json","size_bytes":218},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-11t.1--cod